## SESSION COST TRACKING

Every session auto-logs to: `ops/reports/session-[session-id].json`

Example:
```json
{
  "session_id": "cse_01GjArz2sTk5Pj582uTtcT4M",
  "date": "2026-05-25",
  "task": "Integrate NVIDIA NIM backend",
  "model_used": "claude-opus",
  "input_tokens": 12500,
  "output_tokens": 3200,
  "jcodemunch_hits": 4,
  "rtk_commands": 7,
  "rtk_compression_pct": 78.4,
  "cost_usd": 0.185,
  "cost_guard_triggered": false,
  "duration_seconds": 145
}
```

**Report at session end** — cost will be logged automatically.

