## REFERENCE: jcodemunch Commands

```bash
# Get repo architecture overview (1 call, compressed)
jcodemunch get_repo_map

# Search for symbols by name or pattern
jcodemunch search_symbols "NimClient"

# Get source of a specific symbol
jcodemunch get_symbol_source "lib/nim-client.ts:NimClient"

# Find unused code
jcodemunch find_dead_code

# Get changed symbols (faster than full diff)
jcodemunch get_changed_symbols --since main

# Search in files (grep replacement, compressed output)
jcodemunch search_in_files "TODO\|FIXME" --limit 50
```

---

## REFERENCE: RTK Commands

```bash
# Reset session tracking
rtk gain --reset

# View current session stats
rtk gain

# Compress CLI output
command | rtk compress

# View daily summary
rtk report --date 2026-05-25
```

---

## VIOLATIONS (WHAT NOT TO DO)

❌ Run `git diff` without RTK (outputs all 2000 lines uncompressed)
❌ Cat a 10KB file without checking its size first
❌ Use `grep -r` instead of jcodemunch for symbol search
❌ Assume GPT-5.5 is needed without proving frontier reasoning
❌ Exceed $10 per task without explicit approval
❌ Exceed $50 daily without stopping work

